* '''COUNTER/SECONDSPERTICK''' is used to declare the wanted time duration of one hardware tick in seconds.

The System Timer can be attached to ALARMs as usual, as in the following example:

  ALARM AlarmExample {
    COUNTER = SystemTimer;
    ACTION  = ACTIVATETASK{
       TASK = TaskExample;
    };
  };

